/P 181 0 R
/E <>
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
219 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 181 0 R
/E (We also want to express our appreciation to the Secretary Generals, dear Maizah Hassan and Nada Alghory, and the organization team of this wonderful conference for all of their efforts into making it an unforgettable event and for giving us a platform to discuss the world's most urgent issues.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
