332 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 196 0 R
/E (As the guardian of the United Nations Convention against Transnational Organized Crime, UNODC is the primary legal actor for anti-trafficking efforts. It administers the Palermo Protocol, providing countries with technical and logistics support to help criminalize trafficking. Especially in conflict zones, UNODC works on strengthening the role of law and governments to help and prevent sexual abuse and human trafficking.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
