<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 196 0 R
/E (Since human traffickers operate across borders, INTERPOL acts as the communication hub for national police forces. Their Human Trafficking Expert Group, they can coordinate global operations to break and dismantle the supply chains of organized crime.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [8]
>>
