>>
endobj
353 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 199 0 R
/E (Awareness raising plays an important role in prevention of such horrible crimes against human rights. These initiatives should transcend general message to provide targeted, context-specific education regarding tactics used by traffickers and the risks of exploitation. Informing vulnerable individuals and communities empowers them to make safer decisions.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
354 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 199 0 R
/E (In conclusion, successfully confronting human trafficking and sexual exploitation in conflict zones necessitates a holistic approach that combines strong legal enforcements, survivor-centered services, international cooperation and awareness raising. While these steps provide a solid substructure, they are not thorough. The complex and evolving nature of traffickers and abusers, especially in conflict settings, illustrates the need for continuous adaptations and further discussions among member states.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
